OL,3,GNEWSASearch for missing fishing boat
OL,4,Aidentifies two sites of interest
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo sites have been identified for
OL,7,Ffurther investigation in the search for
OL,8,Fa missing fishing boat off the north of
OL,9,Fthe Isle of Lewis.
OL,11,FThree men were on board the Kilda when
OL,12,Fit disappeared on the 13th of October.
OL,14,FThe body of crew member Douglas Craigie
OL,15,Fwas found by search teams the day after
OL,16,Fthe Kilda failed to port but two other
OL,17,Fmen - Norman Murray and Murdo Morrison
OL,18,F- remain unaccounted for.
